cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this simulator, please cite the RAGNAROC model paper (below, under
  preferred-citation) and, if useful, this repository.
title: Ragnaroc simulator
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Varghese
    given-names: Dheeraj
repository-code: https://github.com/dhevarghese/RAGNAROC-UI
url: https://dhevarghese.github.io/RAGNAROC-UI/
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An interactive, browser-native simulator for the RAGNAROC model of reflexive
  visual attention. The model runs locally in a Web Worker as a TypeScript port
  verified against the reference implementation.
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    Understanding visual attention with RAGNAROC: A reflexive attention gradient
    through neural AttRactOr competition
  authors:
